<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BW/IP started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BW/IP started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc said Wednesday it initiated coverage of BW/IP Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--BW/IP, a Los Angeles-based manufacturer of pumps and seals, has fundamentals that support a 12-to-18-month price target of $18 to $20 based on EPS of $1.13 for FY96 and $1.35 for FY97, Rauscher Pierce said in a report.</p>
<p>--BW/IP was trading at 14-1/8, up 3/8.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
